msgid "Pickle buffer objects"
msgstr "Picklebuffertobjekt"

msgid ""
"A :class:`pickle.PickleBuffer` object wraps a :ref:`buffer-providing object "
"<bufferobjects>` for out-of-band data transfer with the :mod:`pickle` "
"module."
msgstr ""
"Ett objekt av typen :class:`pickle.PickleBuffer` omsluter ett "
":ref:`buffertillhandahållande objekt <bufferobjects>` för dataöverföring "
"utanför bandet med modulen :mod:`pickle`."

msgid ""
"This instance of :c:type:`PyTypeObject` represents the Python pickle buffer "
"type. This is the same object as :class:`pickle.PickleBuffer` in the Python "
"layer."
msgstr ""
"Den här instansen av :c:type:`PyTypeObject` representerar Pythontypen för "
"picklebuffertar. Det är samma objekt som :class:`pickle.PickleBuffer` i "
"Pythonlagret."

msgid ""
"Return true if *op* is a pickle buffer instance. This function always "
"succeeds."
msgstr ""
"Returnera sant om *op* är en instans av en picklebuffert. Den här funktionen"
" lyckas alltid."

msgid "Create a pickle buffer from the object *obj*."
msgstr "Skapa en picklebuffert från objektet *obj*."

msgid ""
"This function will fail if *obj* doesn't support the :ref:`buffer protocol "
"<bufferobjects>`."
msgstr ""
"Den här funktionen misslyckas om *obj* inte stöder :ref:`buffertprotokollet "
"<bufferobjects>`."

msgid ""
"On success, return a new pickle buffer instance. On failure, set an "
"exception and return ``NULL``."
msgstr ""
"Vid lyckat resultat returneras en ny picklebuffertinstans. Vid fel anges ett"
" undantag och ``NULL`` returneras."

msgid ""
"Analogous to calling :class:`pickle.PickleBuffer` with *obj* in Python."
msgstr "Motsvarar att anropa :class:`pickle.PickleBuffer` med *obj* i Python."

msgid ""
"Get a pointer to the underlying :c:type:`Py_buffer` that the pickle buffer "
"wraps."
msgstr ""
"Hämta en pekare till den underliggande :c:type:`Py_buffer` som "
"picklebufferten omsluter."

msgid ""
"The returned pointer is valid as long as *picklebuf* is alive and has not "
"been released. The caller must not modify or free the returned "
":c:type:`Py_buffer`. If the pickle buffer has been released, raise "
":exc:`ValueError`."
msgstr ""
"Den returnerade pekaren är giltig så länge *picklebuf* finns kvar och inte "
"har frigjorts. Anroparen får inte ändra eller frigöra den returnerade "
":c:type:`Py_buffer`. Om picklebufferten har frigjorts utlöses "
":exc:`ValueError`."

msgid ""
"On success, return a pointer to the buffer view. On failure, set an "
"exception and return ``NULL``."
msgstr ""
"Vid lyckat resultat returneras en pekare till buffertvyn. Vid fel anges ett "
"undantag och ``NULL`` returneras."

msgid "Release the underlying buffer held by the pickle buffer."
msgstr "Frigör den underliggande buffert som picklebufferten håller."

msgid ""
"Return ``0`` on success. On failure, set an exception and return ``-1``."
msgstr ""
"Returnera ``0`` vid lyckat resultat. Vid fel anges ett undantag och ``-1`` "
"returneras."

msgid "Analogous to calling :meth:`pickle.PickleBuffer.release` in Python."
msgstr "Motsvarar att anropa :meth:`pickle.PickleBuffer.release` i Python."

msgid "object"
msgstr "objekt"

msgid "PickleBuffer"
msgstr "PickleBuffer"
